.DS_Store

# Local setup. Never commit passwords or connection strings.
*.local.json
.env
setup.json
databases.json

# A user's data model and notes stay out of git.
# This does not ignore notes.template.md or databases.example.json.
*data-model*.md
notes.md
!.cursor/skills/**/*data-model*.md
!.cursor/skills/**/notes.template.md

# Python bytecode from running the tests.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
